<title>INDIA: India's 96/97 rice output seen at 88 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India's 96/97 rice output seen at 88 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's rice output in the 1996/97 (October-September) procurement season is expected to be 88 million tonnes compared with 79.46 million in the same period a year ago, the Civil Supplies Ministry said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The Finance Ministry's annual economic survey for 1996/97 had estimated the 1996/97 (July-June) rice output at 79.6 million tonnes.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
